   "description": [
    "356 WOMANS PARTY HAVE NEW HEAD QUARTERS THE Womans Party moves this week a significant block nearer the White House into its new national headquarters in Lafayette Square From here when the amendment is passed in the Senate the ratification campaign in the States will be directed The house which faces east on the square is rich in historic associa tions Built early in the history of the nation by Hon Levi Woodbury while he was a member of the Cabinet of President Van Buren it became the home of Schuyler Colfax during his vicepresidency Later it was occupied by Mr Dennison of Lincolns Cabinet and with him as host at tained a reputation for official hospitality unrivaled in the citys records The great men who made the history of their time gathered there But the chief human interest is the KeySickles incident For it was from this house then his home that General Sickles stepped forth on the fatal morning when he fired the bullet that terminated the life of his brilliant rival Barton Key whose admiration for the Generals beau tiful wife was cause of gossip in the community Key lived in the famous old clubhouse on Madison"
